== Notes ==
* The four statuettes don't have to be handed in within the same week in order to complete the [[Weekly Jade Vault]]. But it is recommended to turn them in at once because even though the achievement is reset every week, the shown achievement progression is not.
{{bug|The [[Weekly Jade Vault]] achievement is displayed as completed but Myung-Hee doesn't sell items. The dialogue does not disclose the missing statuette(s).}}
* To unlock Myung-Hee as a merchant is necessary to hand in the missing statuettes. In order to know which ones are missing it is recommended to carry all of them with you while talking to her. If she doesn't give you any options to turn in statuettes with all four of them in your inventory, you'll have to wait for the [[weekly reset]] and try again.

